  "releaseNotes": "'## [11.4.0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v11.3.0...v11.4.0) (2026-06-23)\n\n### Features\n\n* **metrics:** added otel metrics support ([#1152](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1152)) ([b652e87](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/b652e87fba55d1e923531d4fb25342d55c67337a)), closes [#1037](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1037)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **ci:** update actions/checkout action to v7 ([#1156](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1156)) ([996d51f](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/996d51f6f67ac729f1780328c1086e2971894dd2))\n* **core:** update aspire monorepo ([#1155](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1155)) ([27b0deb](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/27b0deb789280f9f507f257d44b842cabdceb707))\n* **core:** update aspire monorepo ([#1157](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1157)) ([822c4de](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/822c4deac77093285cef34717be39a11d2f73816))\n* **tools:** update dependency nuget-license to v4.0.12 ([#1158](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1158)) ([4c4271e](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/4c4271e14890ae3ee97d294bdc4a6028dc1d6be0))\n'",
